Application:Speller%20Targets int NumMatrixRows= 8 8 1 % // rows of the display matrix
Application:Speller%20Targets int NumMatrixColumns= 9 9 1 % // columns; odd, so the checkerboard is adjacency-safe
Application:Sequencing int NumberOfSequences= 5 5 1 % // repetitions per selection
Application:Sequencing float StimulusDuration= 64ms 40ms 0 % // flash (4 blocks of 16 ms)
Application:Sequencing float ISIMinDuration= 64ms 80ms 0 % // gap between flashes
Application:Sequencing float ISIMaxDuration= 64ms 80ms 0 % // fixed gap: same as the minimum
Application:Sequencing float PreSequenceDuration= 2s 2s 0 % // cue: the target lit in CueColor (copy mode)
Application:Sequencing float PostSequenceDuration= 3504ms 2s 0 % // pause after each selection: the paradigm's 3.5 s, rounded to whole 16 ms blocks
Application:Result%20Processing int InterpretMode= 1 0 0 2 // 0 none, 1 free, 2 copy (calibration: copy + TextToSpell) (enumeration)
Source:Signal%20Properties int SampleBlockSize= 4 4 1 % // 16 ms blocks at 250 Hz
Filtering int EpochLength= 1400ms 500ms 0 % // time until a flash's result is in: CheckerboardSignalProcessing reports 1.3 s after onset (0.8 s epoch + 0.5 s zero-phase pad), and the speller waits this long
Filtering int EpochsToAverage= 1 1 0 % // one result per flash: every flash has its own stimulus code
Filtering int SingleEpochMode= 1 0 0 1 // report every epoch; otherwise P3TemporalFilter drops every other selection's results (boolean)
